                "text": "Far too many in WV experience the devastating consequences of addiction. The SUPPORT Act could provide needed relief by focusing on prevention, treatment and recovery, and addresses new challenges like increases of fentanyl overdoses and other threats.\n\n@GOPHELP\u2019s passage of this legislation recently is an important step in making sure we continue these important programs.\n\nMORE DETAILS \u2b07\ufe0f\nhttps://t.co/IlTimlW9t9",
